<p>BORROWER MedPartners Inc</p>
<p>AMT $450 MLN	 COUPON 7.375 PCT  MATURITY 10/01/06</p>
<p>TYPE NOTES	   ISS PRICE 99.156  PAY DATE 10/08/06</p>
